>> title: Pork, Apple and Cider Casserole
>> servings: 4
>> tags: main, autumn
>> time: 1 hour 15 minutes

Brown @pork shoulder{800%g}, cubed, in @olive oil{2%tbsp} in a #casserole{}.

Add @onion{2}, sliced, and @leek{1} and soften for ~{8%minutes}.

Pour in @cider{400%ml} and @chicken stock{300%ml}, then add @mustard{1%tbsp} and @sage{4%leaves}.

Simmer covered for ~{50%minutes}, adding @apple{2} in wedges for the final ~{15%minutes}.

Stir in @cream{100%ml} and season with @salt{1%tsp}.
